#~ msgid "This table only includes functions whose cost is set directly with a string literal name — `NativeFunction(\"name\", Map(...), ...)`. Some costs are set through a helper (for example the BigInt arithmetic operators `+`, `*`, `/`, `%`, all `V5 -> 8L`/`V5 -> 64L`, stepping to `1L` at V8, defined via a shared `bigIntArithmeticOp` helper) and aren't captured here, since attributing them correctly would mean guessing at the helper's argument order rather than reading it off a literal. Treat this page as a documented lower bound on what changed, not an exhaustive list — the {doc}`Standard Library Versions <08_stdlib-versions>` page covers every genuinely *new* function and structure field, which this page does not repeat."
#~ msgstr ""

